WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.116 --> 00:00:02.002
- I bet children do this.

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:03.486
Look at my lychee nipples!

00:00:03.486 --> 00:00:04.632
Hillary, please.

00:00:04.632 --> 00:00:06.211
(upbeat music)

00:00:06.211 --> 00:00:07.208
- You never had lychee?

00:00:07.208 --> 00:00:08.642
- No, I don't know what lychee is.

00:00:08.642 --> 00:00:10.531
- I know what lychee the fruit is.

00:00:10.531 --> 00:00:12.299
It comes in brown skin, kind of sweet,

00:00:12.299 --> 00:00:15.342
and on the very very inside
is a very smooth pit.

00:00:15.342 --> 00:00:17.581
- They put those little
(bleep) in my drink sometimes

00:00:17.581 --> 00:00:19.456
and it startles me.

00:00:19.456 --> 00:00:23.843
(upbeat music)

00:00:26.372 --> 00:00:28.090
- How do I eat it, like a jello shot?

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:29.168
- Mine's not opening.

00:00:29.168 --> 00:00:30.287
- Well the child proof is on.

00:00:30.287 --> 00:00:32.910
Think I need a grown-up to
open this thing. (laughs)

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:34.237
- It smells like perfume.

00:00:34.251 --> 00:00:36.473
- This is for classy ladies to wear out,

00:00:36.473 --> 00:00:37.687
not for children to eat.

00:00:37.687 --> 00:00:38.816
- Look if you see the little chunks,

00:00:38.816 --> 00:00:41.247
you can see through them which is bizarre.

00:00:41.247 --> 00:00:42.954
- Oh, there's juice coming out!

00:00:42.954 --> 00:00:44.731
- Do I just suck it?

00:00:44.731 --> 00:00:46.198
(slurping)

00:00:46.198 --> 00:00:48.348
- Oh, it's so much better
tasting than it smells!

00:00:48.348 --> 00:00:50.259
- That's too much, too much!

00:00:50.259 --> 00:00:51.635
- That's really, really good.

00:00:51.635 --> 00:00:54.204
You don't like it, I can tell.

00:00:54.204 --> 00:00:55.312
- I might have another one.

00:00:55.312 --> 00:00:57.153
(slurping)

00:00:57.153 --> 00:00:57.742
- Mmm.

00:00:57.742 --> 00:00:59.270
- It tastes like sugar and perfume,

00:00:59.270 --> 00:01:00.945
and somehow that's not terrible tasting.

00:01:00.945 --> 00:01:03.180
- And it had little
bits of the fruit in it.

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:04.786
- It tastes like a fruit cup

00:01:04.786 --> 00:01:06.930
that I would get in my
lunch pail as a kid.

00:01:06.940 --> 00:01:09.276
- I feel like if hipsters knew
about this they'd love it.

00:01:09.276 --> 00:01:10.322
- I would eat this as a kid

00:01:10.322 --> 00:01:12.083
'cause I ate worse things than this,

00:01:12.083 --> 00:01:13.361
I grew up in Brooklyn, bro.

00:01:14.396 --> 00:01:15.560
- Coconut's like super underrated,

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:17.435
and I think it makes everything better.

00:01:17.449 --> 00:01:21.420
- Now I have milky nipples! (laughs)

00:01:21.423 --> 00:01:22.910
I'm gonna do this every time.

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:24.377
- Whole box smells like
a Bath and Body Works.

00:01:24.377 --> 00:01:25.406
- Ugh!

00:01:26.546 --> 00:01:27.972
(slurping)

00:01:27.972 --> 00:01:31.464
- It's very coconut-y, it's too coconut-y.

00:01:31.464 --> 00:01:33.098
- Coconut-y chemicals.

00:01:33.098 --> 00:01:34.754
- Yeah little bits of chewy coconut.

00:01:34.754 --> 00:01:36.431
That was delicious.

00:01:37.606 --> 00:01:40.686
- Alright, let's get this
outta the way, patow!

00:01:40.686 --> 00:01:42.893
- I'd say mango is an overrated flavor.

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:45.602
One time, made something with
a mango, and I didn't like it.

00:01:45.602 --> 00:01:48.108
(laughing)

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:49.729
- Smells like artificial flavor.

00:01:49.729 --> 00:01:51.143
(slurps)

00:01:51.143 --> 00:01:53.774
- It's got tiny hard chunks
in it that I've been avoiding.

00:01:53.774 --> 00:01:55.469
- Halfway between a mango lassie

00:01:55.469 --> 00:01:57.252
and a mango juice from a can.

00:01:57.252 --> 00:01:59.040
- They're horrible, don't
recommend to any kid.

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:01.875
- This just seems like
a delicious fruit snack

00:02:01.875 --> 00:02:03.872
that American children are missing out on.

00:02:03.872 --> 00:02:06.812
- This is the best candy I've
ever tried in a taste test.

00:02:06.812 --> 00:02:10.299
- Great children's candy,
also great adult candy.

